B.aec=new A.dD("Playverzus.xyz is operated by Playverzus Technologies Inc. (Global Operations: Nairobi \xb7 Delaware \xb7 London). We believe competitive integrity and personal privacy must coexist. We adhere strictly to the principles of Data Minimization and Privacy by Design under international data protection frameworks, including the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the Kenya Data Protection Act (2019). We collect only the minimum information required to operate fair matchmaking, enforce anti-cheat rules, and settle financial escrow.",null)
