B.ae6=new A.dD("Playverzus.xyz utilizes essential authentication cookies and encrypted local storage tokens strictly to maintain your logged-in session state, region selection, and verified machine binding. We do not deploy third-party behavioral advertising trackers or cross-site ad networks. Functions requiring elevated OS permissions (Browser Notifications and Screen/Window Sharing during matches) explicitly prompt for your approval and may be revoked in Cookie & Permissions or browser site settings at any time.",null)
B.Wz=s([B.ae6],t.p)
