B.acg=new A.cY("Betting, Lotteries and Gaming Act (Cap 131, BCLB):","Cap 131 regulates uncertain-outcome betting and games of chance. Direct peer-to-peer skill esports contests without house odds\u2014where participant stakes fund fixed-fee prize pools\u2014alongside risk-free Demo PTS mode are structured under the pure-skill exemption rationale.",B.cD,null)
B.acn=new A.cY("Kenya Data Protection Act (2019):","Enforces our Zero Video Storage policy: frames stay in transient volatile memory with only numeric scores and mathematical integrity hashes persisted.",B.cD,null)
B.ac6=new A.cY("Consumer Protection Act (2012):","Deterministic verification engines, transparent upfront gateway fee disclosures, and formal 15-minute Human-in-the-Loop dispute resolution satisfy fairness standards.",B.cD,null)
