B.ad9=new A.eG("02.",B.cD,"Kenyan Legal & Regulatory Framework (Phase 1 Pilot)",B.VG,null)
B.aen=new A.dD("Under common-law and statutory jurisprudence, gambling requires three concurrent elements: Prize, Consideration, and Chance. Playverzus.xyz operates strictly on contests governed by the Predominance Test, where outcomes depend predominantly upon player physical dexterity, tactical decision-making, reflex accuracy, map knowledge, and execution:",null)
B.aca=new A.cY("Predominance Test Compliance:","Over standard match durations, RNG elements in eligible titles must never outweigh participant skill. Winners are determined by verified highest score, lowest completion time, or official round victory.",B.u,null)
B.ac0=new A.cY("Zero Gambling or House Bank:","Games of chance (roulette, slots, dice, bingo, card lotteries) and house-banked odds are strictly banned. Playverzus does not act as a bookmaker or compete against players; prize pools are funded solely by participant stakes subject to disclosed fixed tier facilitation fees.",B.u,null)
