B.aei=new A.dD("Outcomes certified by dual-player consensus telemetry or official Game Developer Stats APIs settle automatically under Consumer Protection Act (2012) fairness standards. Flagged anomalies route automatically to our Review Queue for Human-in-the-Loop adjudication.",null)
