B.ac8=new A.cY("Global Crossmint USDC & Kenya M-PESA Thresholds:","Global USDC rails: minimum deposit 5.00 USDC (max 5,000.00 USDC per deposit); minimum withdrawal 10.00 USDC (max 10,000.00 USDC per payout). Kenya Phase 1 M-PESA pilot: minimum deposit KES 50, minimum withdrawal KES 150 (ensuring KES 100+ net delivery to M-PESA after standard mobile-money gateway fee), max single withdrawal KES 70,000. Optional Express VIP instant priority payout fee (KES 35 M-PESA / $0.50 USDC) applies only when explicitly selected.",B.u,null)
